      "comparisonReason": "Admin workbench column, not the system Stack: a one-column CSS grid at the admin micro14 gap, which is off CatchStack's gap scale. It pulls AdminPanel span-2 and span-3 children back to one column and can align itself to the start of its parent grid; its compact flag adds a class with no style. It belongs to AdminPrimitives and is redrawn with them in P4/P5. The system Stack is a one-axis token-gap flow with direction, align, justify and collapse."
